## Match predictions
- Exact score: 5 pts
- Result + goal difference (non-draws only): 3 pts
- Non-exact draw (both predicted draw): 2 pts
- Correct result only: 1 pt

## Scorer bonus
- Correct: +2 pts
- Wrong: -1 pt

## Knockout multiplier (CEIL no valor absoluto)
- round_of_32: placar 1.25× | goleador SEM multiplicador
- round_of_16, quarter_final: placar e goleador 1.5×
- semi_final, third_place, final: placar e goleador 2×
- Placar usa apenas 90 min (score.regularTime ?? score.fullTime); goleador conta prorrogação

## Season predictions
- Champion: 30 pts
- Best player: 25 pts
- Top scorer: 20 pts
- Locked after first match
